requirements:
  - Freeze exact latest official stable once at formal-validation start; record resolver evidence. Run installed VSIX from identical source/data on Windows 1.100.0 and that exact version. 1.139.0 feasibility is historical only.
  - "Per environment: startup10 fresh sessions; first-ui10 fresh sessions; reentry-ui30; API warmup100/measured1000; save30; external30; edit-indexing30/edit-ready30; actual same/different-project two-window checks."
  - Each project has exclusive normal800/long100/references50/errors30/duplicate20 (ten distinct pairs), fixed inputs/expectations/order and hashes. Never combine environments to meet counts.
  - UI completes only with expected body in current open popup and no Loading. No observed Loading means no Loading duration. First UI must not be warmed by readiness tests or sentinel requests.
  - Verify API invoke-to-return boundaries, launch-to-index-and-watch readiness, immediate first propagation query then response+50ms, version-correlated edits and nonduplicated role/PID/window memory.
  - Keep progress and partial reports on cancel/exit; product waits have no fixed deadline. Report attempted/success/incorrect/failure/cancel/incomplete/shortage separately, with no fabricated latencies.
  - JSON raw evidence plus Korean Markdown includes environment/settings/clock/source/VSIX/data hashes, rerun commands, API median/p95/max, UI median/max/count/failures, limitations and informational targets.
acceptance_conditions:
  - Run pnpm check, installed-VSIX functional checks and lifecycle cleanup on required Windows versions. Harness/cleanup failures must be fixed; product failures remain explicitly blocked with linked follow-ups, never reported passed.
  - All runnable required scenarios executed; sample shortages justified without artificial product delay. Product blockers have reproducible evidence and linked registered follow-up work.
  - Independent scenario selection/cancel/rerun and observer state calibration verified. Distinguish result completion from supported-environment verification.
  - macOS remains PR34 and Linux PR25; neither is falsely marked tested nor gates this Windows work.
invariants:
  - Default pnpm test:vscode remains functional; performance is explicit and absent from normal CI/hooks. Reuse its build/install/launch/cleanup path; no second launcher.
  - Each scenario owns fresh profiles, sessions and mutable fixtures; no dependency on another scenario's result. Immutable runtime/VSIX/source may be shared.
  - No fixed product-readiness or API/UI/edit/propagation deadline in performance mode. Retain bounded management operations, cancellation, durable progress, partial reports and process-tree cleanup.
  - No product optimization or unrelated bug fixes. Tool defects require repair and affected reruns; product defects require repro and linked separate work, with independent checks continuing.
  - Preserve caller dirty documents and existing worktrees. Do not stash, reset, copy caller changes, merge, push or publish. Task-local commits require execution authority beyond this plan.
  - Use exclusive 800/100/50/30/20 corpus with frozen expectations; no forced refresh/restart for propagation, artificial indexing delays, or invented missing durations.
  - No screenshot/video/OCR in completion or timing. No Playwright Electron launcher. Screenshots only optional diagnostic evidence; manual readings never substitute for samples.
